Hmmm.  I spent a bunch of hours crafting the list culture more than a
year ago (as did others).  I'm expecting to start doing that again in
the near future.  This list was created for discussions about
Extropian ideas related topics.  I'm here to talk about such extropian
things, not defend them; I want this to be my haven, not the stalking
grounds for bozos from another meme-set.  I have no interest in
setting up a system in which people could zap me just because they
don't like my reaction to their favorite religion.  I do have other
ideas which I will write about in due course.

	 signed such a policy.  I'd be willing to try it.  Lord knows we could
	 use something more to encourage politeness here.

Peer pressure.  After we revamped the list more than a year ago, we
kept the list smooth, productive, and conducive to quality discussions
by simply maintaining standards, and encouraging other people to do so
with private email to people that started going off on tangents or
flaming.  I'm going to start encouraging that again.  

Formal processes are no substitute for the informal processes that
shape a culture and a social group.  We need to encourage those again.

